<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Apr 22 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are:</p>
<p>copper down 1875, tin up 85, lead down 125, zinc up 725, aluminium down 4700, nickel up 408, aluminium alloy down 140</p>
